        "filing_date": "2026-03-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Since nafamostat is approved in Japan and South Korea for the treatment of DIC and acute pancreatitis, we may focus on of these indications for development of our first LTX-608 product candidate.",
