        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-009387",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We currently have a single contract manufacturer that is producing the nafamostat active ingredient for Niyad, and a separate contract manufacturer producing the finished product used for development, both of which can support eventual commercial needs.",
